    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ve just joined Melody School, and it\u2019s not exactly a warm welcome.</strong><br>Bullies are waiting in every hallway, but you\u2019ve got a secret weapon \u2014 rhythm.<br>In this fast-paced rhythm game, hit the correct arrow keys in time with the music to unleash your musical power and fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Face off against bullies in music-driven battles<br>\u2714 Match falling arrows with your keys to the beat<br>\u2714 Arrows come faster as the songs get more intense<br>\u2714 Choose from 3 difficulty levels per song<br>\u2714 Defeat enemies to progress through 4 unique stages<br>\u2714 Unlock achievements as you master each track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got the beat to beat the bullies?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ve just joined Melody School, and it\u2019s not exactly a warm welcome.</strong><br>Bullies are waiting in every hallway, but you\u2019ve got a secret weapon \u2014 rhythm.<br>In this fast-paced rhythm game, hit the correct arrow keys in time with the music to unleash your musical power and fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Face off against bullies in music-driven battles<br>\u2714 Match falling arrows with your keys to the beat<br>\u2714 Arrows come faster as the songs get more intense<br>\u2714 Choose from 3 difficulty levels per song<br>\u2714 Defeat enemies to progress through 4 unique stages<br>\u2714 Unlock achievements as you master each track</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got the beat to beat the bullies?</p>",
